Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:22:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): name clearance links when the retract hop is off

Pass the optional retract state to the shared roughing Lead tab.
Keep the stored link choice and name the effective plane.
Pin both roughing kinds against Heights and viewport labels.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3318
